C("ABDK CVF-12 and CVF-13 (major): the delta slot hash used target and currency unmasked.",
  "Closed in both copies: src/libraries/CurrencyDelta.sol:12-13 and src/libraries/TransientStateLibrary.sol:38-39. "+NA10, "src/libraries/CurrencyDelta.sol:12")
