# ---------------- ABDK minor, by group ----------------
C("ABDK minor group, compiler version pragmas: CVF-51, 52, 55, 57, 60, 70, 72, 75, 76, 77, 79, 81, 86, 87, 88, 90, 98, 99, 101, 105, 108, 111, 113, 123, 124, 127, 129, 131, 132, 135, 137, 138, 142, 145, 146, 148, 149, 150, 152, 155, 165, 166, 167, 169, 170, 171, 172 and 175.",
  "Pragmas do not select the compiler here. foundry.toml fixes solc 0.8.26, via_ir, 44444444 optimizer runs and the cancun EVM version, and PoolManager.sol:2 pins 0.8.26. The build needs PUSH0, MCOPY, TLOAD and TSTORE on the target chain (A10), which the opcode vector probes recorded in state/cleared.json confirmed on all 21 networks.", "src/PoolManager.sol:2")
C("ABDK minor group, gas and readability: CVF-58, 59, 63, 64, 66 to 69, 71, 73, 74, 78, 82 to 85, 93 to 96, 103, 104, 106, 107, 110, 114, 118 to 122, 126, 133, 134, 136, 139 and 140.",
  "None changes a result. Where the text was touched it keeps the value: the bitmap mask (TickBitmap.sol:97), the constant hash length (PoolId.sol:14), the loop condition (Pool.sol:344) and the compound assignments (Pool.sol:375 and 381). The transient slot constants that CVF-136 asks to derive equal keccak256 of their names minus one for all four names (cycles/007/core-code-audit-walk-b.work/consts_check.out). "+N0, "src/libraries/TickBitmap.sol:97")
C("ABDK minor group, errors, events, naming and documentation: CVF-53, 54, 56, 61, 62, 65, 80, 89, 91, 100, 102, 112, 115, 125, 141, 143, 144, 147, 151, 153, 154, 156 to 164, 168, 173 and 176.",
  "No fund effect. Several errors now carry arguments (TickMath.sol:14-16, LPFeeLibrary.sol:12, IProtocolFees.sol:11) and the controller event argument is indexed (IProtocolFees.sol:20). setProtocolFee emits ProtocolFeeUpdated (ProtocolFees.sol:40) and setLPFee emits nothing, as under Spearbit 5.2.4. "+N0, "src/ProtocolFees.sol:40", 'L5')
C("ABDK minor group, constants and bounds: CVF-92 (hardcoded price bounds), CVF-97 (error bounds, see Spearbit 5.2.3), CVF-110 (fee thresholds) and CVF-117 (order of the price limit checks).",
  "The numbers are right. MAX_SQRT_PRICE_MINUS_MIN_SQRT_PRICE_MINUS_ONE at src/libraries/TickMath.sol:35-36 is built from the same two literals as the bounds, and the wrapped subtraction at TickMath.sol:127 rejects every price outside the range, including MIN_SQRT_PRICE - 1 and 2^160 - 1 (cycles/007/core-code-audit-walk-b.work/math_model.out). The thresholds 1001 and 1001 << 12 match a cap of 1000 per direction. The limit checks run before the loop (Pool.sol:322-338). "+NA10, "src/libraries/TickMath.sol:127")
C("ABDK minor group, code that no longer exists: CVF-128 and CVF-130 (unused imports), CVF-131 (Reserves.sol), CVF-150, CVF-151 and CVF-174 (the fee controller callback).",
  "Lock.sol and NonzeroDeltaCount.sol have no imports, Reserves.sol is replaced by CurrencyReserves.sol, and there is no IProtocolFeeController in src/interfaces and no call to the controller in src/ProtocolFees.sol. "+N0, "src/ProtocolFees.sol:44", 'L5')

